%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorMargin": 40, "messageMargin": 30}} }%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant Evi as Evidence (network-state/v1, incident/v1)
  participant OptSvc as Optimization/Emergency service (RECOMMEND)
  participant Op as Operator/Dispatcher (REQUEST)
  participant Sup as Supervisor/Incident Commander (APPROVE)
  participant OPA as OPA policy engine
  participant Cmd as Command service
  participant Exec as system:command-executor (EXECUTE)
  participant Adapt as Simulator adapter
  participant Ver as Outcome verifier
  participant Aud as Audit service (append-only)

  Evi->>OptSvc: current state + incident evidence
  OptSvc->>Op: recommendation/v1 (alternatives, safety_bounds, expires_at)
  Op->>Cmd: command/v1 (status=requested, idempotency_key)
  Cmd->>Aud: log request
  alt safety class SC-1 or SC-2
    Op->>Sup: request approval (different person, four-eyes)
    Sup->>Cmd: approved_by (must != requested_by)
  else safety class SC-0
    Note over Op,Cmd: requester's REQUEST is sufficient, no second approval
  end
  Cmd->>OPA: policy-decision/v1 input (role, action_type, target, evidence_freshness_seconds)
  alt evidence stale or expired or policy unavailable
    OPA-->>Cmd: deny (reason required)
    Cmd->>Aud: log denial
    Cmd-->>Op: status=denied / expired
  else permit
    OPA-->>Cmd: permit
    Cmd->>Exec: dispatch approved command
    Exec->>Adapt: execute (registered, idempotent action only)
    Adapt-->>Exec: acknowledgement + observed state
    Exec->>Cmd: status=executed
    Cmd->>Aud: log execution
    Cmd->>Ver: request outcome verification
    Ver->>Evi: read independent pre/post window
    alt effective
      Ver-->>Cmd: outcome/v1 classification=effective
    else unsafe or unknown
      Ver-->>Cmd: outcome/v1 classification=unsafe/unknown
      Cmd->>Exec: rollback
      Exec->>Adapt: revert
      Cmd->>Aud: log rollback/escalation
    end
  end

  Note over Sup,Aud: OVERRIDE (incident_commander, SC-2 only) requires justification, always audited, never for SC-0/SC-1
